    {
      "id": "urn:li:activity:7519551400771723264",
      "text": "Looks like Wednesday was a hard day for everyone despite the PHP incident. Just received an email from Railway. They apparently had a big security breach and are recommending users to change passwords, swap API keys, and even check their audit logs. Thankfully I have not hosted anything on railway at this point of time, but this is a heavily used system in the Web Development community. If you did not know about this already, check your emails and make sure you stay safe in regards to this breach",
