      "id": "urn:li:activity:7516218558327132161",
      "text": "ATTENTION BUSINESS OWNERS, COUNTY/TOWN OFFICALS, AND WESTERN NORTH CAROLINA RESIDENTS!!! On December 4, Wilkes Community College's Carolina Cyber Network Interns are giving a FREE (that's right! completely free!!!) Cyber Safety and Security presentation about keeping your businesses, employees, and online resources safe. If you are interested, we also will he hosting as a part of the presentation a FREE Live Vulnerability assessment of your website if you sign up and select the 'Rapid Fire Assessment' checkbox at the bottom of the registration form!\n\nJoin us December 4 at 1pm to learn how your businesses could be at risk. and how to secure them!\nRegister by scanning the QR-Code at the bottom of the flyer, or by visiting https://lnkd.in/euuRiv2A\n\nHope to see you there!",
